        "Gien ye Faransi ka dugu ye. Dugumogo be taa jon yooro (2015).",
        "Ukrayina ni Belarus jamana nataw labanna ka faranfasi ka bɔ Irisi nata la san kɛmɛda 14nan na, ka kɛ Litwanie Duchy belebele dɔ ye (fo ka se san kɛmɛda 18nan ma, nin jamana fila in tun bɛ ɲɔgɔn fɛ, ani Ukraine ni Belarus kanw daɲɛw bɛ bɛn ɲɔgɔn ma hali sisan ni 84%).",
        "1914 Mansamara Nicholas II ye dankari kɛ Ukraine sɛbɛnnikɛla ŋana Taras Shevchenko bangeli san 100nan seli la Risi Mansamara kɔnɔ",
        "Feburuyekalo tle 20, san 2014, k’a sɔrɔ Yanukovych tun bɛ Kiev, Irisi ye Crimea gun minɛni daminɛ Ukraine saheliyanfan na, o kɔfɛ a ye lakana di Yanukovych ma, min bolila ka bɔ jamana kɔnɔ. Awirilikalo tle 12, san 2014, Irisi ye binkanni daminɛ Ukraine kɔrɔnyanfan fɛ tuma min na sɔrɔdasi minnu ɲɛmɔgɔya tun bɛ Risi jamana lakanani baarada ɲɛmaa Igor Girkin bolo, olu ye bɔnbu da Minɛ Sloviansk dugu kan. O dugujɛ, awirilikalo tile 13, san 2014, Ukraine ye terrorisme (jatigɛwale) kɛlɛli daminɛ Irisi ka binkanni kama",
        "Yapen ye gun ye Ɛndonezi ka Schouten Gunw kɔnɔ. Biak Gun bɛ saheli fɛ ani New Guinea bɛ kɔrɔn fɛ.",
        "Yamato siya, min fasokan ye Zapɔnkan ye, olu de ye jamanaden fanba ye. Fɛnɲɛnɛmako siratigɛ la, a bɛ Eurasie gun kɔrɔn fɛ ani a bɛ kɛ Pasifiki tasuma-yɔrɔ ye . Komin a ye gun jamana ye wa a ka mara lamininen bɛ ni kɔgɔji ye, dugukolo dancɛw tɛ yen . Japon gunw ye gun 14125 ye , Honshu, Hokkaido, Kyushu, Shikoku ani Okinawa. Waati cogoya bɛ daminɛ subarctic la worodugu fɛ ka taa subtropical la saheli fɛ. A bɛ sigida la min ka teli ka kɛ balawu suguya caman ye, wa dugukolo yɛrɛyɛrɛ hakɛ ni tiɲɛni hakɛ min bɛ sɔrɔ balawu fɛ, o ye diɲɛ kɔnɔkobaw dɔ ye .",
        "Institut Mozdahir International n’a bԑ fᴐ a man ko IMI ye Kԑnyԑrԑye jԑkulu min tԑ politiki ton na, a siginna sen kan san 2000 Serifu Muhamadu Ali Ayidara (Chérif Mohamed Aly Aïdara) fԑ. A baju sigilen bԑ Dakare. IMI ye jamaruya sԑbԑn sᴐrᴐ ka baara kԑ i ko Kԑnyԑrԑye jԑkulu jamana caman fԑ an ka dafԑ jamananw kᴐnᴐ i n’a fo Mali, Senegali, Kɔnɔwari, Gine Bisau o na ɲᴐgᴐn na caman.",
        "Serifu ye sԑbԑnnin damadᴐ kԑ silamԑya dinԑ kan ciden Muhamadu kisi ni hinԑ bԑ a ye buruju ani alimamu 12 kan alubetu Ala ka hinԑ u la. A kitaabu caman bᴐra. U na cogo filԑ:",
        "APPEL Chérif Mohamed Ali Aïdara, guide des chiites : «Partout dans le monde, les musulmans sont opprimés». Le Quotidien.",
        "Les pressions faites sur notre communauté ne nous ébranlent point. Enquete Plus.",
        "A ye sɛbɛnni kɛ Afiriki politiki ni tariku kan, i n’a fɔ La naissance du maquis dans le Sud-Cameroun (Paris, Karthala, 1996). On the Postcolony bɔra Pari san 2000 faransikan na ani tubabukan bamanankan bamanankan bɔra University of California Press fɛ, Berkeley, san 2001. San 2015, Wits University Press ye Afiriki bɔko kura bɔ. Marisikalo tile 14 san 2024, Achille Mbembe ye san 2024 Holberg ka laadalata sɔrɔ seko ni dɔnko ni sɛbɛnni, hadamadenya, sariya ani diinɛko la. O bolodiɲɔgɔnma in bɛ kɛ zuwɛnkalo tile 6 san 2024, Bergen Iniwɛrisite la, Norvege jamana na.",
        "Ko te Times Higher Education (THE), i mua ko te Times Higher Education Supplement (THES), he moheni Ingarangi e whakaatu ana i nga korero me nga take e pa ana ki te maatauranga teitei.",
        "A cikin 2019, an yi ta yayatawa cewa Elsevier, wanda ya riga ya yi haɗin gwiwa tare da THE don tattara martabar jami'a, yana shirin ɗaukar Babban Ilimin Times gaba ɗaya.",
        "Davies, Anjuli. \"TPG to buy TSL Education for 400 million pounds\". Reuters. Retrieved 8 July 2013.2",
        "\"RELX said to be planning £100mln takeover of Times Higher Education\". Proactiveinvestors UK. 27 November 2018. Retrieved 30 August 2019.",
        "Michael Joseph Jackson (29 uti 1958, Gary, Indiana, Amerika - 25 Zuwɛnkalo 2009, Los Angeles, California) tun ye dɔnkilidala ni dɔnkɛla ye.",
        "Costalago, Vicente (2021) Fabules, racontas e mites .",
        "Hamdullahi ka Kalifa (Arabukan na: خلافة حمد الله; fana: Dina ka Massina, Sise Jihad jamana) min bɛ fɔ kosɛbɛ ko Massina mansamara (a bɛ fɔ fana ko Maasina walima Macina) tun ye san kɛmɛ tan ni kɔnɔntɔnnan daminɛ Fulbe Jihad jamana ye min cɛmancɛ tun bɛ Niger Delta Kɔnɔna yɔrɔ la min bɛ wele sisan Mali Mopti ni Ségou maraw la. A faaba tun bɛ Hamdullahi.",
        "Kuma hɔrɔnya ye sariyakolo ye min bɛ mɔgɔ kelen walima sigida ka hɔrɔnya dɛmɛ walasa k’a hakilinaw fɔ k’a sɔrɔ u ma siran waleɲumandɔn ɲɛ, walima sariya ka jalaki. A ka c’a la, kuma hɔrɔnyalen daɲɛ bɛ fɔ cogo lafiyalen na nka, sariya siratigɛ la, a bɛ kunnafoni walima hakilinaw ɲinini, u sɔrɔcogo ani u dicogo wale suguya bɛɛ sen don, a mana kɛ fɛɛrɛ o fɛɛrɛ ye.",
        "FP-45 tun ye pistoli nɔgɔlen ye, min tun bɛ se ka ci siɲɛ kelen, min tun dilannen don walasa a sɔngɔ ka dɔgɔ ani a ka teliya ka dilan jamaba la. A tun bɛ ni nɛgɛ yɔrɔ 23 dɔrɔn ye minnu fanba tun ye taamasiyɛn ye ani minnu jiginna, minnu sɔngɔ man gɛlɛn ani minnu dilanni tun ka nɔgɔn. A ye .45 ACP pistolet cartouche ci ka bɔ barika la min tɛ marifa la. O dantigɛli in kosɔn, a tun dabɔra baara kama yɔrɔ surun na, yaada 1–4 (mɛtɛrɛ 1–4). A ka se ka baara kɛ cogo min na, o tun bɛ se mɛtɛrɛ 8 ɲɔgɔn dɔrɔn ma. Ni marifa tun bɛ yɔrɔ jan, marifa tun bɛna daminɛ ka bin ani ka bɔ sira kan. FP-45 musaka fɔlɔ min dira, o tun ye dɔrɔmɛ 2,10 ye/a kelen (o bɛ bɛn dɔrɔmɛ 35 ma san 2021 ), o ye tɔgɔla tɔgɔ juru don a la ko \"Woolworth pistol\". Marifa duuru tun bɛ se ka mara pistoli minɛyɔrɔ la.",
        "Glosa ye dugukolo kan dɛmɛnan jɔlen ye min sinsinnen bɛ Interglossa kan (dɛmɛnkan dɔ sɛbɛn tɛmɛnen dɔ bɔra san 1943). Glosa daɲɛgafe fɔlɔ bɔra san 1978. Kan tɔgɔ bɔra gɛrɛkikan na glossa kɔrɔ ye kan walima kan.",
        "Taamaʃyɛn min kɛra ka baara daminɛ marifa misɛnnin otomatiki kura dabɔli la Soviyetiki sɔrɔdasikulu ye, o kɛra Technique Conseil ka lajɛ ye min kɛra URSS jamana ka lafasalitɔn ka fanga kɔrɔ Zuluyekalo tile 15 san 1943, o min kɛra, o kɛra sababu ye ka Alemaɲi marifakisɛ MKb.42 (H) (StG-44 nata prototype) dilancogo sɛgɛsɛgɛ ani k’a kalan, Hugo Schmeisser ye min dilan diɲɛ kɔnɔ, ka ɲɛsin diɲɛ kɔnɔ masa cɛmancɛ kariti fɔlɔ ma, n’o ye milimɛtɛrɛ 7,92 Kurz kalifa 7,92 × milimɛtɛrɛ 33 ye, ka fara Ameriki ta kan light self-loading carbine M1 Carbine (Garand) supplied under the Lend-Lease program chambered for .30 Carbine caliber 7.62 ×33 mm, nafa kɔlɔsira ka sɔrɔdasi bilenmanw ka marifaw sɔrɔ minnu ni Ameriki ni Alimanjamana ta bɔlen don, nka a yiriwara ka don jateminɛ kɛ Soviyetikiw ka dilan kalanso kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnenw na ani iziniba in cogoyaw la, min tiɲɛna kosɛbɛ kɛlɛ san fɔlɔw la, ka fara kariti \"cɛmancɛ\" hakilina dɔnni kan.",
        "San 1944, ka kɛɲɛ ni sɛgɛsɛgɛli jaabiw ye, AS-44 binkannikɛlan min dilanna A. I. Sudayev fɛ, o yamaruyara ka yiriwa ka taa a fɛ. A Bɔra 'sèn misɛnninw na, sɔrɔdasi-kɔrɔbɔli minnu Kɛra sàn nata kaban ni samiyɛ la GSOVG la, ka Fàra sɔrɔdasi-kulu damadɔ kan URSS jamana kɔnɔ. Hali ni seginnkanni ɲumanw kɛra, sɔrɔdasi ɲɛmɔgɔw y’a ɲini ka dɔ bɔ marifaw hakɛ la.",
        "Zwelidumile Geelboi Mgxaji Mhlaba \"Dumile\" Feni (Mekalo tile 21, san 1942 – 1991) tun ye bi waanɛ min bɔra Farafinna Woroduguyanfan. A lakodɔnnen don Katlego Lhuzwayoboth kama. Jɛgɛncogo tun b'a ka jadila n'a ka ɲɛgɛnniw kɔnɔ. U tun bɛ to ka siyawoloma kɛlɛli Farafinna Woroduguyanfan kɔnɔ jira min tɔgɔ ye Apartheid ye. Feni m'a wari soro a ka baara la. Tiɲɛ yɛrɛ la, a tun bɛ jɔnya la ani faantanya jugumanba la.",
        "1965: Transvaal Academy, Johannesburg, South Africa",
        "1966: Trans-Natal, Natal Society for Arts, Durban, South Africa",
        "1975: South African Sculpture, Goodman Gallery",
        "1967: Sculpture South Africa, 1900: 1967, Adler Fielding Galleries, Johannesburg, South Africa",
        "1982: Art towards Social Development: an Exhibition of South African Art, National Museum and Art Gallery, Gaborone, Botswana",
        "Joël Claude Mpah Dooh ye kalanden ye min ye dɔnniyasɛmɛtiyasɛbɛn sɔrɔ Conservatoire Municipal des Beaux-Arts of Amiens (Faransi) la.",
        "Eclipse, solo exhibition, Fondation Jean Paul Blachère, Apt (Francia)",
        "Les galeries plastiques itinérantes, Ouagadougou, Bamakɔ, Lome, Niamey, Akra, Dakar",
        "Animismes, group show, Da Vinci Gallery, Nice",
        "Jɛkulu ka jirali, 7nan Hawana Biennale, Hawana",
        "O filimu ye Prix Jutra tɔgɔlatɔn wɔɔrɔ sɔrɔ Jutra Jara 15nan na san 2013, ka kɛ ɲɛnajɛla ŋana (Trelles Turgeon), ɲɛnajɛla ŋana (Quesnel), Seko ni dɔnko ɲɛnabɔli ɲuman (Éric Barbeau), Sinema kɛcogo ɲuman (Mathieu Laverdière), dɔnkili fɔlɔ ɲuman (Normand Corbeil ) ani mankan ɲuman (Luc Boudrias, Marcel Chouinard ani Patrice Leblanc).",
        "Brendan Kelly, \"Maana dibi, min bɛ mɔgɔ bila ka miiri, fanga bɛ min na cogo kabakoma na; Maana min bɛ taa dɔɔnin dɔɔnin, o lase ɲɛnamaya la ni mɔgɔ kabakomaw ye\". Montréal Gazette, Ɔkutɔburukalo tile 26, san 2012.",
        "Bi, nɛgɛsobaw bɛ ka bila bi nɛgɛso nɔgɔlen DMU nɛgɛso dilanni nɔ na. Bi nɛgɛso dizili-kuran, minnu bɛ se ka boli ɲɔgɔn fɛ i n’a fɔ fɛn caman, i n’a fɔ Stadler RS1, Siemens ka RegioSprinter walima Siemens Desiro min tugura a nɔ na, olu jɔyɔrɔ n’u ka fɛn ɲɛfɔlenw bɛ ɲɔgɔn ta ni nɛgɛsobaw ye (hali n’a y’a sɔrɔ ɲɛtaa kɛra mankan na, duguma dilancogo dɔgɔyali la, sɛnɛfɛnw musaka dɔgɔyali la, teliya la ani fɛɛrɛ wɛrɛw la) nka a ka c’a la, u tɛ fɔ u ma ni « nɛgɛso » daɲɛ ye tugun.",
        "[ɛˈɡɔːli] ) (a bɛ fɔ a ma ko Jozi, Joburg, Jo'burg walima \" Sanu dugu \") ye dugu ye min ka ca ni dugu tɔw bɛɛ ye Afiriki tilebinyanfan fɛ, a bɛ jate megacity ye ; a ye duguba 100 dɔ ye diɲɛ kɔnɔ . Demographia, ka fɔ la, Johannesburg– Pretoria duguba (n’u farala ɲɔgɔn kan k’a sababu kɛ bolifɛnw cɛsira barikamaw ye minnu bɛ taa-ka-segin kɛ) ye 26nan ye diɲɛ kɔnɔ jamanaden hakɛ ta fan fɛ, a sigibagaw ye 14.167.000 ye. O ye mara faaba ani duguba ye Gauteng, min ye mara nafolotigiba ye Afiriki Saheli kɔnɔ. Johannesburg ye sariyasunba kiritigɛso sigiyɔrɔ ye, min ye kiritigɛsoba ye Afiriki tilebinyanfan fɛ. Afiriki tilebinyanfan ka tɔnba ni bankiw fanba ka biroba bɛ Johanɛsiburugu. Dugu in bɛ Witwatersrand kuluw kɔnɔ minnu falen don minɛnw na, diɲɛ kɔnɔ minɛnko, sanu ani (kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnenya la) diamant jago cɛmancɛ.",
        "Ɛsipaɲi, min bɛ wele fana ko Ɛsipaɲi masaya, ye jamana ye min bɛ jamana wɛrɛw la, Erɔpu tɔnba kɔnɔmɔgɔ don, min sigira senkan iko jamana min bɛ sariya kɔnɔ sigida ni demokarasi la ani min ka gɔfɛrɛnaman cogoya ye pariti masakɛ ye A ka mara, n’a faaba bɛ Madrid, labɛnna ka kɛ yɛrɛmahɔrɔnya jɛkulu tan ni wolonwula ye, minnu bɛ sigi senkan u nɔ na ni mara bi duuru ye ; ani yɛrɛmahɔrɔnya dugu fila .",
        "Sahara woroduguyanfan Afiriki ye hadamadenw ka denso ye, Homo sapiens wolola yɔrɔ min na, sisan cɛ, min ye farafinna jamanaw bɛɛ mara .",
        "A laban na, a \" laadalakow jiginni nafama tun bɛna kɛ Sahara woroduguyanfan fɛ. A bɛ san fo , Homo sapiens tun bɛna Richard Klein ka baarakɛnafolo ye , , walima ka tugu fɛn falen dɔ kɔ kabini a bɔra a san 300.000 ye nin ye &nbsp; — hakili ni sigidako sekow kulu dɔ, min bɛ dantigɛli kɛ kɛwalew ka biɲɛdimi » . O jiginni in tun bɛna a ka yiriwali ɲɛtaa ɲɛfɔ farafinna kɔkan, kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnenya la Eurasie jamana ka koloniyali jikuruba waati la a : .",
        "Sahara kungo bɔli tun bɛna daminɛ Tortonian, Ma cɛ ani a tun bɛna tugu Thetys bɔli kɔ . O in Le désert ne s'établit donc pas de manière définitive ; il connaît des alternances d'aridité et de fertilité (« Sahara vert »), au gré des variations de la Zone de convergence intertropicale et donc de la pluviométrie, influencée par les cycles de Milanković. Sahara Gɛrɛn fasa dɔ fana bɛ se ka kɛ sababu ye ka ɲɛsin hominid Sahelanthropus tchadensis bɔli ma bi Tchad jamana na, My ago . Kɔlɔsili minnu kɛra kɔgɔji ni farafinna nɔgɔw kan, olu y’a jira ko Sahara wuluwulu ni kɔ kɛra kɔnɔ ; o yɔrɔ kelen-kelen bɛɛ bɛ san ba 2 fo 3 ɲɔgɔn ta walasa ka yiriwa, a bɛ se a dan na san ba 4 fo san ba 8, o kɔfɛ a bɛ san ba 2 fo 3 ɲɔgɔn ta ka ban. O sɛrɛkiliw tun bɛna tali kɛ hominidw ka jiginni ni u ka jiginni na .",
        "Sahara woroduguyanfan Afiriki tora diɲɛ mara ye min kɔnɔ denmisɛnninw ka saya hakɛ ka ca ( ‰ ka kɛɲɛ ni ‰ ye diɲɛ kɔnɔ) . Nka Unicef, OMS ani Diɲɛ Banki ka jɛkafɔ dɔ y’a jira ko ɲɛtaa caman kɛra. O hakɛ in dɔgɔyara tiɲɛ na san 1990 ni 2010 cɛ jamana fanba la minnu ɲɛsinnen don o ma, n’a ma fɔ Somali, Zimbabue ani Kameruni . Jamana naani , Liberiya , Eritreya ani Malawi&nbsp; — hali bɛ sira kan walasa ka san ba kelen yiriwali kuntilenna (MDGs) sɔrɔ. Nin laɲini in, min kɛra san 2000 Nasiyɔn Zini fɛ, o laɲini ye ka faantanya ban diɲɛ kɔnɔ san 2015 . O sɔrɔcogo dɔw ye denmisɛnninw ka saya dɔgɔyali ye ni tila sabanan fila ye ni laɲini ye ka kɛ ‰ ye Sahara woroduguyanfan Afiriki kɔnɔ .",
        "Desertec porozɛ, min laɲini tun ye ka 0,3 dafa % dugukolo kungow miliyɔn na minnu bɛ tile funteni-sɛnɛyɔrɔw la, o tun bɛna dugukolo in kuran mago ɲɛ san 2009 ( TWh ɲɔgɔn/san ) , nka a tun bɛna kɛ jamanaw nafa kama, minnu nafa ka bon kosɛbɛ, a bɛ iko a tun bɛ nɛnɛ waati dɔɔnin dɔrɔn .",
        "Marseille ye, ni ye, o ye duguba filanan ye jamana kɔnɔ Pari kɔfɛ . O ye sɔrɔko santiriba ye ani Franse Midi duguba ye, ani a bɛ mɔgɔ ɲɔgɔn lajɛ bɛ a ka duguba kɔnɔ, o ye jamana sabanan ye, Pari ni Liyɔn ta kɔfɛ . O ye jagokɛyɔrɔba ye min nafa ka bon kosɛbɛ Faransi Mediterane kɔgɔjida la ani Faransi jamana bɛɛ kɔnɔ, ka fara a kan a nafa ka bon kosɛbɛ Mediterane jamana bɛɛ la, izini baara nafamaw cɛmancɛ min kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnen don petoroli ni petoroli sɛnɛni, kurun dilanni ani izini suguya caman na, a ye kunnafoniko yɔrɔ fana ye Pari, Itali, Suwisi ani Ɛsipaɲi cɛ siraw bɛ ɲɔgɔn sɔrɔ yɔrɔ min na. Marseille ye diocèseba dɔ sigiyɔrɔ ye ani Aix-Marseille Iniwɛrisite, min sigira senkan san 1409.",
        "Kabini a y’a ka fanga ta san 2017, a ka fanga kɛra sababu ye ka sigidamɔgɔw ka gɛlɛya waatiw kɛ i n’a fɔ baarakɛlaw ka sariyasun sinsinni, sariya min bɛ Faransi nɛgɛso tɔnba ladilan, SNCF, Benalla ko, vest jɛmanw ka tɔnba, ka kɛ laban ye min nafa ka bon kosɛbɛ jamanakuntigi Makɔrɔn ka san duuru kɔnɔna na kabini, k’a daminɛ san 2018 nowanburukalo la, jamanakuntigi tun bɛ jamanadenw ka ɲɔgɔn sɔsɔli cɛmancɛ la min daminɛna jamanakuntigi y’a jira kɔfɛ ko dɔ bɛna fara takasi kan sɛnɛfɛnw sɔngɔ kan san 2019 zanwuyekalo tile fɔlɔ O jaabi la, Macron ye ban ka takasi wuli, ka laseli kɛ ko dɔ bɛna fara sara fitinin (SMIC) kan, n’o ye ɛrɔ 100 ye kalo o kalo san 2019.",
        "O ye kan ye min bɛ mɔgɔ bila a dan na, a daɲɛsugu bɛ min na, a daɲɛsugu bɛ min na.",
        "Lagos (a bɛ fɔ tubabukan na : ; Yorubakan na ) ye Nizeriya duguba dɔ ye min sigibagaw ka ca ni miliyɔn 15,3 ye ani duguba filanan ye Afiriki gun kan Kinshasa kɔfɛ (min kɔnɔmɔgɔw bɛ se miliyɔn 15,6 ma ). A ka ca ni miliyɔn 15,3 ye intramural sigibagaw la, aglomeration kɔnɔ min ka ca ni ye san 2021, a ye Kayira ni Kinshasa tɛmɛn san 2000 waatiw la, o kɛra push demographic barikama kɔlɔlɔ ye. Lagos ye dugu ye, duguba kɔnɔ, min ka ca ni jamana tɔw bɛɛ ye Afiriki kɔnɔ ka tɛmɛ Kairo (mɔgɔ miliyɔn 20) ani Kinshasa (mɔgɔ miliyɔn 17).",
        "Jɛkulu min bɛ se ka suma ni o ye, n’o ye Afrique-Équatoriale Française (AEF) ye, o sigira senkan Cɛma Afiriki san 1910 .",
        "Fɛderasiyɔn in ma jɔ san 1958 Sɛtanburukalo la, jamanadenw ka lajɛba kɔfɛ Faransi jɛkulu nata kan, ani jamanadenw ka maraw ye wote kɛ walasa ka wuli ka kɛ yɛrɛmahɔrɔnya jamanaw ye, fo Gine, min ye wote kɛ yɛrɛmahɔrɔnya kama.",
        "San 1939, AOF ka sanu bɔli sera nɛgɛ , a fanba bɔra aluvium nafabɔli la ni sanu panni laadala fɛɛrɛw ye Kot divoire, Faransi Sudan ani kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnenya la Sanfɛ",
        "lamɛnni)), a bɛ fɔ fana ko Valence-sur-Rhône, ye Faransi dugu ye ani komini min bɛ Drôme mara la, Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes mara la. tariku kɔnɔ, a ni Dauphiné mara kɔrɔ bɛ tali kɛ ɲɔgɔn na .",
        "I n’a fɔ jenerali kuntigi ani jamana kuntigi, Napoléon y’a ɲini ka jɛkuluw tiɲɛ minnu sigira senkan ani ka wari sɔrɔ Angletɛri masaya fɛ ani minnu, kabini san 1792, ye Erɔpu masakɛw lajɛ ɲɔgɔn fɛ Faransi n’a ka fanga kama min bangera Revolisiyɔn fɛ. A ye Franse kɛlɛbolow ɲɛminɛ ka bɔ Itali ka taa Nil ani ka bɔ Ɔtirisi ka taa Prusse ani Pologne : Bonaparte ka sebaaya caman ni cɛɲiw ( Arcole, Rivoli, Pyramides, Marengo, Austerlitz, Jena, Friedland ), sɔrɔdasi kanpaɲi teliyalenw na, o bɛ jɛkulu naani fɔlɔw bɔ u nɔ na. Hɛrɛ minnu tugura ɲɔgɔn kɔ, minnu ye nin jɛkulu kelen-kelen bɛɛ ban, ye fanga di Faransi ma ani ka fanga hakɛ dɔ di Napoléon ma min tun man teli ka kɛ Erɔpu jamanaw na fɔlɔ, Tilsit hɛrɛ waati la (1807).",
        "Franse , min bɛ wele ko a posteriori Fɔlɔ , ye France fanga ye ka bɔ..., don min na Napoléon Bonaparte ye Faransi masakɛ ye senatus-consulte fɛ, ka se a ka fanga bilali fɔlɔ ma san, o kɔfɛ a segintɔ Pari kan ka se ka Komisiɔn ka faranfasi ma san . Fɔlɔ min jatera i n' a fɔ Repibiliki Fɔlɔ tɛmɛsira, ka sɔrɔ ka tɔgɔ fɔlɔ ta .Empire français--+san 1809, a Konsila kɔ, a tigɛra Seginkanni Fɔlɔ sanni a ka fanga segin a cogo kɔrɔ la tile kɛmɛ kɔnɔ, o kɔfɛ, seginkanni filanan kɛra",
        "Mugu bɛ bɔ burukisɛw de la kosɛbɛ — malo nɔgɔlen (malo), spelt walima rye . A bɛ se ka kɛ ka mugu fara a kan, ni hakɛ danmadɔ ye, ka bɔ dumunifɛn wɛrɛw la minnu tɛ buru dilan i n’a fɔ shɔ, orje, malo durum, ɲɔ, shɔ, noye, a ɲɔgɔnnaw Buru sumanw bɛ dɔn ni farikolojɔli dumuniw ye minnu bɛ se ka a gluten ni elastic properties, min bɛ gazi ɲuman bugunw minɛ minnu bɛ bɔ fermentation fɛ, o bɛ sira di mugu wulicogo ma, min bɛ wele ko ka kurukurunin da .",
        "Jatebla bɛ danfara Bɔ dɔnniya tɔw la ni jɛɲɔgɔnya kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnen ye ni tiɲɛ ye bawo kɔlɔsili ni ko kɛlen tɛ tali Kɛ fɛn farikolomaw la. ; jatebɔ tɛ dɔnniya ye min bɛ kɛ ni ko kɛlenw ye . U ye hakili-la-ko ye pewu, u sinsinnen bɛ aksiyɔmuw kan minnu fɔra tiɲɛ ye walima postulates ( fɔcogo) minnu Sɔnna waati dɔɔnin kɔnɔ. O aksiyɔmu ninnu de b’a jusigilanw Kɛ wa o la u tɛ Bɔ kumasen wɛrɛ la. Jatebla kumasen – min bɛ Weele kosɛbɛ, a tiɲɛni kɔfɛ, teori, proposition, lemma, fact, scholia walima corollary – o bɛ jate ko tiɲɛ ye ni kumasen fɔlɔ min b’a ka tiɲɛ sigi sen kan, o bɛ hakililata dɔ bonya min bɛ wele ko demonstration, walima logical-deductive reasoning. kuma min ma jira fɔlɔ nka o bɛɛ n' a ta a jatera ko a bɛ se ka da a la, o bɛ wele ko jateminɛ .",
        "Denmisɛnw ka telewisɔn ɲɛmɔgɔba don, a ye baara kɛ san 1991 Disney Club la, a tora yen fo san 1994, o kɔfɛ a seginna san kelen o kɔfɛ fo san 1999 ni Francesca Barberini ye fila-fila. O san na, a ye telewisɔn ka ɲɛjirali dɔ fana kɛ min tɔgɔ ye ko Big!",
        "Nizɛri, Mali ani Burukina Faso y’a jira k’u bɛ bɔ jɛkulu in kɔnɔ san 2024 zanwuyekalo tile 28, o ye ko ye min ɲɔgɔn ma deli ka kɛ kabini CEDEAO dabɔra, k’a jira kɛrɛnkɛrɛnnenya la, dɛmɛnbaliya jɛkulu in fɛ terrorisme ɲɛkɔrɔ, k’a jalaki ko a bɛ... jamana wɛrɛw ka fanga ka fanga.",
        "Şalpazarı, min tun bɛ wele fɔlɔ ko Ağasar, ye Trabzon mara ye. A ni Trabzon cɛ ye bam 69 ye. Kɔgɔji Dugulen mara la Ottoman Mansamara ka mara kɔnɔ, a tun bɛ Görele mara la, min tun bɛ Trabzon la o waati la, nka san 1798 a tun bɛ Vakfıkebir mara la. A ka mɔgɔw yɔrɔ min nafa ka bon kosɛbɛ o ye Turkmen/Chepni ye.",
        "Silamɛw fanba, Soninkew tun ye siya fɔlɔ dɔ ye ka bɔ Tilebi Afrika ka silamɛya kɛ silamɛya la san kɛmɛda 10nan ɲɔgɔn na. Sonikekaw ka bi jamanaden hakɛ bɛ Tɛmɛ miliyɔn 2 kan. Soninkekaw ka laadalakow bɛ tali kɛ Mandekaw ta la, ani Moritani Imiragenw ta. U dɔw ye silamɛya laadala furusiriw ye, bolokoli, ani u bɛ ni sigida tilali ye. .",
        "San 1960w la, 20th Century Fox donna wariko gɛlɛya waati dɔ la, a labanna ka sɔrɔ American International Pictures fɛ san 1966. O studio in ka nafolo jiginna san 1970 waatiw la, waati min na a ye filimu caman sɔrɔ minnu ye mɔgɔw nisɔndiya i n’a fɔ \"Star Wars,\" Ja laban jirali,\" ani \"Alien.\"",
        "Kerecɛnya (min bɔra Gɛrɛkikan na Χριστός — \"Munen, Masiya\") ye diinɛ ye min sinsinnen bɛ Yesu Krisita ka kalanw kan. Ka fara silamɛya ni Budadiinɛ kan, a ye diɲɛ diinɛ saba dɔ ye. Kerecɛnya jogo dɔ, min b’a faranfasi ka bɔ Ala kelenpeya yɔrɔ wɛrɛw la, o ye (diinɛ dɔw la) dannaya ye Yesu Krisita la iko Ala farikolomaya ni a jirali hadamadenw bɛɛ ni hadamadenw ka jɛkulu kisili kama ani ka bilasirali kɛ tiɲɛ na. Silamɛya ni Yahutu diinɛ tɛ i n’a fɔ kerecɛnya, u t’a dɔn ko Yesu Krisita ye Sebaayabɛɛtigi ka hypostases dɔ ye. Ibrahima ka diinɛ dɔ (min bɔra Semitiki la, Yahutu diinɛ fana, silamɛya).",
        "2CH tun ye jagokɛyɔrɔ ye Sydney, Ɔsitarali jamana na, min datugulen don zuwɛnkalo tile 10 san 2022 a kɛlen kɔ ka san 90 ni kɔ kɛ fiɲɛ na A tun bɛ Pacific Star Network bolo. Sani o ka Kɛ telewisɔn in cogoya Yɛlɛmana zuwɛnkalo tle 10 san 2022.",
        "Yɛrɛfaga ye Waleya ye min kɔnɔ Mɔgɔ bɛ sa a yɛrɛ ma, Mɔgɔ 720.000 bɛ sa Yɛrɛfaga fɛ San o san , U bɛ sa misali la ni Nooses ye, Shooting, ka bin boon kan, a ɲɔgɔnnaw",
        "Abila Poku tun ye farafinna ka masamuso dɔ ye. A ka waati tun ye sankɛmɛ tan ni sabanan. A ye bawule masaya jɔ.",
        "NewJeans (Korekan na: 뉴진스), kɔfɛ a tɔgɔ jiginna ka kɛ NJZ (Korekan na: 엔제이지), ye Kore Dugu npogotigi kulu ye min sigira senkan san 2022 ADOR fɛ, n’o ye Kore Dugu ɲɛnajɛko tɔnba HYBE bolo. Jɛkulu in kɔnɔmɔgɔw ye mɔgɔ duuru ye: Minji, Hanni, Danielle, Haerin ani Hyein. Jɛkulu in lakodɔnnen don u ka fɔlifɛnw n’u ka fɔcogo fɛ ni Pop ani RnB fɛnw ye minnu bɔra san 1990 ni 2000 waatiw la, minnu kɛra ni bi fɔli ye.",
        "Ciden Paul (a bangera i n’a fɔ Saul min bɛ bɔ Tarse) ani a tun bɛ wele fana tuma caman na ko Paul senuma (2 sanni Krisita ka se–64/65), tun ye Masiya Yahutu-Romɛ sɛbɛnnikɛla ani rabi ye. A tun ye mɔgɔ ye min jiginna kerecɛnya la. A bɛ fɔ ko a ye Bibulu kitabu tan ni saba sɛbɛn, u bɛɛ lajɛlen bɛ wele ko Paul ka batakiw. Olu ye batakiw ye minnu cilen bɛ egilisiw ni kerecɛnw ma. A ye o lɛtɛrɛw sɛbɛ walisa k’u jija, k’u dɛmɛ k’u ka Krecɛn kalansira faamu, ani k’u dɛmɛ u ka Krecɛn ɲɛnamaya kɛ.",
        "A bɔra a ka premiyɛri minisiri ɲɛmɔgɔya la Kongo kɔntilili waati (Septanburu 1960), a minɛra, nka a bɔra libɛri la nɔɔma, a minɛra kɔfɛ 1 Desanburu. A dira Katanga jamana ma, a faga 17 Zanwiyɛ 1961.",
        "- Chanteurs traditionnels des Iles Seychelles (1978) – *Seychelles ka donkilidala kɔrɔw*"
    ]
}
